ol</li> </ul> <p>Need to learn some of this markdown formatting…</p> <hr/> <p>blank blank blank</p> <blockquote> <p>Do the alligator signs make quotes? —me</p> </blockquote> <p>Some more words</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="posts"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Testing out the posting system]]></summary></entry></feed>